\p
\v 26 When¦37724 Elizabeth was¦37730 six months¦37726 pregnant, \nd God¦37737\nd* sent¦37730 his messenger¦37732 Gabriel¦37733 to¦37738 \nd Nazareth¦37746\nd*, a city¦37739 in¦37723 the¦37740 Galilee¦37742 region.
\v 27 Gabriel went to a young woman named Maria¦37765 who was engaged to be married to Yosef, a descendant of \add King\add* David¦37759,\x + \xo 1:27: \xt Mat 1:18.\x*
\v 28 and entering the¦37769 room, spoke to her¦37772, “Hello there. \nd Yahweh¦37779\nd* is with¦37780 you and he's chosen you to be honoured.”
