\v 30 as the messenger¦37811 continued¦37808, “Don't¦37815 be scared, Maria¦37817, because¦37820 \nd God¦37824\nd* is showing his favour¦37821 on you¦37819,
\v 31 and listen, you'll conceive¦37827 a baby and go on to give birth to a son¦37832, and you must¦37827 name¦37836 him¦37837 \nd Yeshua¦37838\nd*.\x + \xo 1:31: \xt Mat 1:21.\x*
\v 32 He'll be very special and will be called¦37846 ‘the son¦37844 of the highest¦37845 one’, and \nd Yahweh¦37851 God¦37853\nd* will give¦37848 him¦37850 the throne¦37855 of David¦37856, his¦37859 ancestor.\x + \xo 1:32-33: \xt 2Sam 7:12-13,16; Isa 9:7.\x*
\v 33 He'll reign¦37861 over¦37862 Yacob's descendants throughout the ages¦37868, and¦37869 his¦37872 kingdom¦37871 will¦37874 never end¦37875.”
\p
\v 34 “How would this work,” Maria¦37879 asked the messenger¦37882, “because¦37887 I've never slept with a guy?”
