\v 35 “The¦37894 holy \nd spirit¦37898\nd* will come¦37900 over¦37900 you,” answered¦37893 the messenger¦37895, “and the power¦37904 of¦37905 the highest¦37905 one will overshadow¦37906 you, and so the holy child¦37915 that'll be born¦37912 will be called¦37916 God's son¦37917.
\v 36 Also¦37919, your¦37925 relative¦37923 Elizabeth¦37921 has¦37929 also¦37926 conceived¦37929 a son¦37930 in¦37931 her¦37933 old¦37932 age—the one who¦37941 was¦37941 called¦37942 barren¦37943 is¦37939 now six months¦37937 pregnant
\v 37 because with¦37952 \nd God¦37955\nd*, his statements always come to pass.”\x + \xo 1:37: \xt Gen 18:14.\x*
\p
\v 38 “Listen¦37963,” said Maria¦37962, “I'm \nd Yahweh's\nd* servant girl. May everything you¦37972 said come true.” Then¦37961 the messenger¦37979 left her¦37977.
