\p
\v 39 Several days¦37986 later, Maria¦37983 determined that she'd go to the town¦37996 in the hills of¦37997 Yudea
\v 40 where Zekaryah and Elizabeth lived. She¦37999 entered the¦38001 house¦38002 and greeted¦38005 Elizabeth,
\v 41 and as soon as Elizabeth¦38019 heard¦38011 the greeting¦38015, her baby¦38024 in¦38025 her womb¦38027 kicked¦38020, and she was filled¦38034 with the holy¦38036 \nd spirit¦38035\nd*
\v 42 and she¦38041 called out loudly¦38044, “Out of \add all\add* women¦38050, you¦38057 have been blessed and the baby in your¦38057 womb¦38056 has been blessed.
\v 43 How could¦38063 this¦38061 happen to¦38060 me—that¦38061 the mother¦38065 of my¦38068 \nd master¦38067\nd* would come¦38063 and¦38058 visit me!
\v 44 You see¦38071, as soon as I heard your¦38079 greeting¦38078, the baby¦38088 in my¦38083 womb¦38093 kicked¦38084 with excitement,
\v 45 and¦38095 the¦38099 woman¦38099 who believed¦38100 that¦38101 everything \nd Yahweh¦38108\nd* told her¦38106 will happen, she will be¦38102 blessed¦38098.”
