\p
\v 59 When¦38272 the baby boy was eight¦38279 days old, it was the time to¦38281 circumcise¦38281 him, and¦38272 \add the relatives at the ceremony\add* started calling¦38285 him Zacharias¦38293 after¦38287 the name¦38289 of¦38292 his¦38292 father¦38291,\x + \xo 1:59: \xt Lev 12:3.\x*
\v 60 but¦38301 the¦38296 baby's mother¦38297 spoke up and¦38294 said¦38299, “No, he's¦38302 going to be¦38302 named Yohan¦38306.”
\p
\v 61 “None of your¦38320 relatives¦38318 have that¦38327 name¦38325,” they¦38308 said¦38308
