\v 63 So¦38343 Zacharias requested¦38344 a writing tablet¦38346 and¦38343 wrote¦38347, “His¦38354 name¦38353 is¦38350 Yohan¦38349.” Everyone was amazed
\v 64 and then¦38365 suddenly his¦38369 mouth¦38368 and tongue¦38373 were freed and he¦38376 was¦38376 able to speak¦38376 again and started praising \nd God¦38379\nd*.
\v 65 Everyone¦38398 who lived nearby was a bit unnerved by all this, and¦38392 the story about what happened was discussed¦38401 \add in all the homes\add* around¦38389 the hills
\v 66 and¦38407 those who heard¦38411 about it were thinking to themselves, “Who's this¦38425 young child¦38424 going to turn out to be¦38426?”
