\v 35 \wj Instead, you¦43278 all¦43278 should love¦43275 your enemies¦43277 and do¦43280 good and lend¦43282 out even when you expect¦43285 to get nothing¦43283 back. Then your reward¦43289 will¦43287 be large¦43291 and you'll all be children of¦43300 the¦43300 highest¦43300 \+add God\+add* because¦43301 he¦43302 is¦43305 good to ungrateful¦43308 and evil¦43310 \+add people\+add*.\wj*
