\v 39 Then¦43377 Yeshua told them a parable¦43379: “\wj Surely¦43381 a blind person can't¦43381 be¦43386 a guide for someone else who's blind. Won't both¦43389 of them fall¦43393 into¦43390 a ditch?\wj*\x + \xo 6:39: \xt Mat 15:14.\x*
