\p
\v 41 “\wj How come you¦43412 notice the speck¦43414 in someone else's eye, yet don't¦43431 even notice the log that's in your¦43421 own¦43429 eye?\wj*
\v 42 \wj How can you tell¦43437 that person, ‘Hey, let me get that speck out of your eye,’ when you can't¦43466 even see the log in \+em your\+em* eye? You hypocrite, get the log out of your eye and¦43479 then¦43480 you'll be¦43481 able to¦43495 see clearly¦43481 so you can remove the speck in the other person's eye.\wj*
