\v 45 \wj A good person produces good deeds as a result of all the good things inside them, and¦43558 an evil person produces evil actions as a result of the evil \+add inside\+add*, because¦43574 what comes out¦43573 of your mouth¦43582 originates in your mind¦43553.\wj*\x + \xo 6:45: \xt Mat 12:34.\x*
