\v 49 \wj But¦43662 the person who listens \+add ≈but¦43660\+add* doesn't put the message into practice is¦43666 like a man¦43667 that¦43678 just built¦43668 his house on¦43672 the ground¦43674 with no foundation¦43676, and when the flood¦43683 dashed¦43679 against¦43679 it¦43686, the house immediately¦43685 collapsed and broke into many pieces.\wj*”
