\v 39 When¦44586 the Pharisee¦44588 who had invited¦44592 Yeshua saw¦44585 this, he said¦44598 to himself¦44597, “If¦44600 that man was a prophet¦44603, he'd know¦44604 who she is and¦44586 what¦44608 kind¦44608 of¦44608 woman¦44610 it is that's touching¦44613 him¦44615, because¦44616 she breaks God's laws.”
