\v 45 \wj You¦44746 didn't¦44745 kiss¦44743 me¦44744 \+add when I entered\+add*, but¦44748 this¦44747 woman¦44747 hasn't stopped kissing¦44755 my¦44756 feet¦44758 since I came¦44751 in.\wj*
