\v 29 \add He said this\add* because¦45552 Yeshua had commanded¦45550 the evil spirit¦45555 to come¦45559 out¦45559 from¦45562 the man¦45564. The demon had animated him many times¦45567 and he'd \add needed\add* to be put in¦45575 chains¦45573 and shackles¦45575, but¦45570 he would break them off and the demon would drive¦45584 him into¦45591 the wilderness¦45594.
