\v 7 \wj Then¦47899 stay in¦47897 that same¦47898 house and eat¦47905 and drink¦47907 what they give you, because¦47912 the worker¦47914 is¦47911 worthy¦47911 of his¦47917 compensation. Don't¦47919 be moving¦47920 from¦47922 house to¦47924 house.\wj*\x + \xo 10:7: \xt 1Cor 9:14; 1Tim 5:18.\x*
