\v 33 \wj Then a man from¦48532 Shomron¦48532 \+add (Samaria)\+add*\wj*\f + \fr 10:33 \ft The Judeans and the Samaritans despised each other and disagreed on many vital issues.\f* \wj who was on a trip came¦48536 across him, and when he saw¦48540 him he felt¦48542 sorry for him\wj*\x + \xo 10:33-34: \xt 2Ch 28:15.\x*
