\v 5 Then¦48907 he¦48908 told them, “\wj \+add Imagine\+add* you¦48913 had¦48914 a friend¦48915 and went¦48917 to¦48918 them at¦48920 midnight¦48920 and asked, ‘Friend¦48927, lend¦48928 me¦48929 some bread\wj*
