\v 8 \wj I'm telling all¦48992 of you¦48992 that even¦48994 if that friend wouldn't get up and give them anything because¦49007 of their friendship, then the¦49010 friend will¦49015 certainly get up and give them \+add some food\+add* if they persist¦49011 \+add in knocking\+add*.\wj*
\v 9 \wj So¦49021 this is what I'm telling you: \+add Keep submitting\+add* your requests¦49026 and it'll be given¦49028 to¦49029 you all, keep searching and you'll all find¦49032 \+add what you're looking for\+add*, keep knocking¦49033 and the door will¦49035 be opened¦49035 for you all,\wj*
