\v 17 but¦49220 he¦49219 knew¦49221 their¦49222 thoughts¦49224 and told them, “\wj Any kingdom¦49229 that's divided against¦49232 itself¦49233 is¦49236 doomed, and any household that's divided will self-destruct.\wj*
\v 18 \wj So¦49244 if¦49243 Satan¦49247 was¦49252 fighting against¦49248 himself¦49249, how¦49254 could his¦49258 kingdom¦49257 even remain? Yes, I know that you're all saying¦49261 that I must be Beelzebul in order to drive out¦49265 demons¦49270,\wj*
