\v 26 \wj so it¦49419 goes¦49419 and finds seven¦49430 other¦49426 spirits¦49427 more¦49428 evil¦49428 than itself¦49429. They all move in and live there¦49435, so the result is that the person¦49441 ends up worse¦49443 in the end than \+add they were\+add* at the beginning.\wj*”
