\v 34 \wj Your¦49657 eyes are like the¦49651 lamp¦49650 for your body. Whenever¦49658 your eyes are healthy¦49664, your \+add entire\+add* body will be bright¦49672, but¦49677 when your eyes are evil¦49679, your body is¦49685 also¦49681 dark,\wj*
