\v 37 When¦49732 Yeshua \add had a break from\add* speaking¦49734, a member¦49743 of the Pharisee¦49743 party¦49743 invited him¦49740 over for breakfast¦49747, so¦49746 he went into the house and¦49732 sat¦49755 down¦49755,
