\v 39 But¦49791 the \nd master¦49779\nd* said¦49776 to¦49780 his host, “\wj Yes, all of you in the Pharisee¦49785 party¦49785 clean¦49794 the outside¦49788 of the cup¦49790 and the plate, but¦49777 your¦49799 insides¦49798 are full¦49801 of theft¦49802 and wickedness¦49804.\wj*
