\v 48 \wj Because¦49992 of that, you're all¦49981 \+add actually\+add* admitting and agreeing to¦49987 what your¦49991 ancestors¦49990 did, because¦49992 they¦49993 killed¦49995 them¦49996 and \+add then\+add* you build¦49999 their¦49999 tombs¦49999.\wj*
\v 49 \wj That's why \+nd God¦50009\+nd* in his wisdom¦50007 said¦50010, ‘I'll¦50011 send¦50011 prophets¦50015 and missionaries to¦50013 them¦50014, which they¦50021 will¦50021 \+add then\+add* persecute¦50023 and kill¦50021\wj*’
\v 50 \wj so that¦50032 the blood¦50028 of those prophets¦50031 which¦50032 was spilt from¦50035 the creation of the world¦50037 \+add onwards\+add* would then be¦50026 charged to this¦50042 generation¦50041.\wj*
\v 51 \wj \+add This goes all the way back to\+add* to the blood of Hevel¦50046 \+add (Abel)\+add*, right up to the blood of Zekaryah who was \+add recently\+add* killed between¦50059 the altar¦50061 and¦50062 the temple sanctuary. Yes, I'm telling all of you¦50068, \+add those crimes\+add* will¦50070 be¦50070 charged to \+em this¦50075\+em* generation¦50073.\wj*\x + \xo 11:51: a \xt Gen 4:8; \xo b \xt 2Ch 24:20-21.\x*
\p
\v 52 “\wj You¦50077 religious law experts won't¦50089 end well, because¦50080 you took¦50082 away¦50082 the key¦50084 to knowledge¦50086—not only did you not enter \+add yourselves\+add*, but¦50091 you also forbade¦50095 others from entering.\wj*”
