\v 1 By then the crowd¦50160 had¦50154 grown to many thousands¦50158, so much so that they were trampling¦50163 on each other. Meanwhile Yeshua told his¦50172 followers¦50171, “\wj \+add ≈Make sure that you're not influenced by the hypocrisy¦50183 of the Pharisee¦50180 party¦50180—it spreads around like yeast in bread dough\+add*.\wj*\x + \xo 12:1: \xt Mrk 8:15; Mat 16:6.\x*
