\v 4 “\wj And I'm telling you, my¦50233 friends¦50232, that you shouldn't¦50234 be¦50236 afraid¦50236 of those who can kill¦50239 your body¦50241 (and¦50229 after¦50246 that they don't¦50234 have¦50253 anything¦50256 more¦50255 that they can do¦50257).\wj*
