\v 7 \wj Yes, \+add God\+add* even¦50303 knows the¦50304 number¦50312 of hairs¦50305 on your¦50310 head¦50309 so don't¦50315 worry, \+add each\+add* one of you is of more value¦50322 than¦50322 \+add a whole flock of\+add* birds.\wj*
