\v 30 \wj because¦50808 people in every country in the world¦50813 are¦50816 looking¦50816 for¦50816 that, but¦50819 your¦50817 father¦50822 \+add already\+add* knows¦50824 that you¦50826 need those things.\wj*
\v 31 \wj Rather you¦50840 should be striving \+add to enter\+add* his¦50833 kingdom¦50832, and¦50836 then all¦50840 these¦50837 things will come as a bonus.\wj*
