\v 14 \wj However after he'd used up all¦53354 his¦53353 funds, a terrible famine¦53356 hit that¦53363 country¦53362, and¦53364 he started¦53366 to¦53368 become¦53355 needy,\wj*
\v 15 \wj so he¦53371 went and¦53369 signed up to work for one¦53372 of the local farmers who assigned him to feed¦53385 the pigs¦53386 out in the fields¦53383.\wj*
\v 16 \wj As the pigs¦53402 were¦53400 eating¦53400 their carob¦53398 pods¦53398, their food started to look desirable¦53388 to him¦53407, but¦53387 he wasn't given any.\wj*
