\p
\v 25 “\wj The man's older son¦53604 was \+add out working\+add* in¦53608 a field¦53609, and when he was heading home and got near the house¦53620, he could hear¦53621 \+add the sound of\+add* music¦53622 and dancing¦53625\wj*
