\v 2 \wj so the owner called¦53808 him and¦53807 asked, ‘What's¦53812 this¦53813 I'm hearing¦53814 about you? Give back¦53817 the ledgers because¦53824 I don't¦53823 want you as a manager¦53821 any more.’\wj*
