\v 7 \wj Then¦53921 he¦53919 asked the next one, ‘How¦53922 much¦53922 do you¦53920 owe?’ ‘A hundred¦53927 containers of¦53929 wheat¦53929,’ the man replied. ‘Get the contract form and¦53921 change it to¦53935 eighty¦53944,’ said¦53933 the manager.\wj*
