\v 34 \wj I'm telling you¦55182, two¦55189 \+add people\+add* will be in one bed¦55191 on that¦55183 night¦55186 and one will be taken¦55196 and the¦55199 other¦55200 one will be left¦55201 \+add behind\+add*.\wj*
