\v 6 He's¦61396 not¦61391 here—he's¦61396 been brought back to life. Remember how¦61400 he spoke¦61401 to you¦61402 all¦61402 when you were still¦61403 in¦61406 Galilee¦61408\x + \xo 24:6-7: \xt Mrk 8:31; 9:31; 10:33-34; Mat 16:21; 17:22-23; 20:18-19; Luk 9:22; 18:31-33.\x*
\v 7 and he said¦61409, ‘\wj It's necessary¦61417 for the son¦61413 of humanity to be handed over¦61418 to sinful¦61422 people¦61421, and to be executed¦61424 on a post, and then to \+add come back to life\+add* on the third¦61427 day¦61428.’\wj* ”
