\p “What happened to the man¦61652, \nd Yeshua\nd* from \nd Nazareth¦61648\nd*,” they¦61640 answered. “He was a prophet¦61653 who¦61650 did powerful miracles and delivered a powerful message¦61660 in front of \nd God¦61665\nd* and all¦61667 the people¦61669.
\v 20 The¦61677 chief¦61678 priests¦61678 and our¦61682 rulers¦61681 handed him¦61676 over¦61675 to be sentenced to death¦61685, and he was executed¦61687 on¦61687 a post.
